{"content":[{"c":["BETH-DAGON"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Shrine of the Philistine and Canaanite god Dagon mentioned in several sources other than the Bible. A fortress called Dagon near Jericho was mentioned by the Jewish historian Josephus, for example. Many Canaanite locations may have been known for their shrines to Dagon:"],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Town in Judah’s lowlands (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.41","r":"Josh.15.41","rawR":"Josh.15.41","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.41","value":"Josh.15.41"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:41"},"). This Beth-dagon was mentioned both by Ramses III of Egypt and by Sennacherib of Assyria (701 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},") as having been captured by them."],"sourceClass":"list-space","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Town on the border of Asher’s territory, east of Mt Carmel (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.27","r":"Josh.19.27","rawR":"Josh.19.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.27","value":"Josh.19.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:27"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Temple in Ashdod (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.5.1-2","r":"1Sam.5.1-2","rawR":"1Sam.5.1-2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.5.1-2","value":"1Sam.5.1-2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 5:1-2"},"; called Azotus in ",{"href":"?bref=1Macc.10.83-84","r":"1Macc.10.83-84","rawR":"1Macc.10.83-84","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Macc.10.83-84","value":"1Macc.10.83-84"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Macc 10:83-84"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BethDagon","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:41","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.41","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.41","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.41"},{"anchorText":"Jos 19:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.27","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.27","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.27"},{"anchorText":"1 Sm 5:1-2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.5.1-2","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.5.1-2","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.5.1-2"},{"anchorText":"1 Macc 10:83-84","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Macc.10.83-84","rawQueryValue":"1Macc.10.83-84","sourceRefExact":"1Macc.10.83-84"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"5fa1df424da09295ce7cb01998e911797bac8f842a969c6e69ee11cf8447ed33","sourceItemName":"BethDagon","sourceItemOrder":239,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BethDagon","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Beth-Dagon","title":"Beth-Dagon","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}